            <div xml:id="d1402">

                <pb facs="0928" n="812" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg812"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/266.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Spanish Ambassador.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 13, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: I beg to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your note of May 10, in which it is stated that your Embassy is
                    in receipt of a telegram from Señsor Armendaiz, under date of May 9, to the
                    effect that the Constitutionalists at Monterey have forced the representative of
                    his firm in that city to give them a draft of $12,000 on Senor Armendaiz, and
                    that, if this draft were not paid, the agent would be put into the
                    penitentiary.</p>
                <p>Upon receipt of your note, I am pleased to inform you, a telegram was despatched
                    to the Department’s special representative at El Paso, instructing him to bring
                    this matter to the attention of General <pb facs="0929" n="813" xml:id="pg813"/>
                    Venustiano Carranza and to use his best efforts to have the latter revoke the
                    order mentioned, thus relieving Senor Armendaiz from the payment of this amount.
                    I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
